e\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cindrid-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Cindrid|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61835:Player-11-0E985DCC:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 2]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s21_4092\",\"timestamp\":1772503379},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Saltheril\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lord Saltheril says: Sin'dorei politics require a great deal of subtlety. An intricate dance that we were simply born to perform.\",\"id\":\"s21_4093\",\"timestamp\":1772503416},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Saltheril\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lord Saltheril says: Oh, and the invitation addressed to Murder Row is not a mistake. I'm ever a fan of dramatics.\",\"id\":\"s21_4094\",\"timestamp\":1772503425},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Willië-Barthilas\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Willië-Barthilas|h[|cfff48cbaWillië-Barthilas|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61506:Player-3723-0C52DAA7:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Allied Race: Haranir]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s21_4095\",\"timestamp\":1772503457},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ranger-Captain Dawnfletch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ranger-Captain Dawnfletch says: This is for the war bonds party? Alright. I can spend some time rubbing elbows to get some noble gold in Farstrider coffers.\",\"id\":\"s21_4096\",\"timestamp\":1772503473},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magistrix Bloodflame\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magistrix Bloodflame says: My dear, I would have attended even without his invitation. He and I have played this game for the aristocracy many times now. I will get my things.\",\"id\":\"s21_4097\",\"timestamp\":1772503496},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Abidan-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Abidan-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeAbidan|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61836:Player-11-0EAF38AC:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 3]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s21_4098\",\"timestamp\":1772503504},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Sanfu-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Sanfu-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffSanfu|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:60891:Player-11-0EACB8D4:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Crimson Rogue]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s21_4099\",\"timestamp\":1772503509},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Knight-Lord Sunguard\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Knight-Lord Sunguard says: I 