\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Udderbutter-Daggerspine\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Udderbutter-Daggerspine|h[|cfff48cbaUdderbutter-Daggerspine|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41287:Player-1136-097E3BC3:1:3:3:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772563768,\"id\":\"s21_4336\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: The seekers did not cry out for the goddess's return. They listened, and waited, in the quiet places where memory clings.\",\"timestamp\":1772563835,\"id\":\"s21_4337\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Some creatures became consumed with gluttony, in order to fill the void created from her departure.\",\"timestamp\":1772563852,\"id\":\"s21_4338\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Some creatures still sang in harmony with her.\",\"timestamp\":1772563862,\"id\":\"s21_4339\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: The creatures remembered where she had been.\",\"timestamp\":1772563866,\"id\":\"s21_4340\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rutaani Sapling\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"The Rutaani does not react to your presence, it continues to sit silently.\",\"timestamp\":1772563873,\"id\":\"s21_4341\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Some creatures forgot her song and listened only to the silence that followed.\",\"timestamp\":1772563873,\"id\":\"s21_4342\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: The stones echoed her song, but this one was different. Within it the song stirred, yearning to share its tune.\",\"timestamp\":1772563881,\"id\":\"s21_4343\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Echo of Memory\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"A faint echo shimmers into view, its gentle motion urging you to follow.\",\"timestamp\":1772563894,\"id\":\"s21_4344\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: They followed not a path, but an echo of feeling.\",\"timestamp\":1772563894,\"id\":\"s21_4345\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Pandare