:\"Kel'vujo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kel'vujo says: Don't keep me waitin' long. De other Amani will want to see all de trophies we got!\",\"timestamp\":1772808953,\"id\":\"s23_4114\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:237359::::::::90:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Refulgent Copper Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx3\",\"timestamp\":1772808974,\"id\":\"s23_4115\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kel'vujo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kel'vujo says: H-hold on! We can split de trophies... I was just yankin' your tusks!\",\"timestamp\":1772808981,\"id\":\"s23_4116\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Huntmaster Jinki\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Huntmaster Jinki says: Dat is enough, Kel'vujo! You know de punishment of cheatin' on a trial.\",\"timestamp\":1772808987,\"id\":\"s23_4117\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Huntmaster Jinki\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Huntmaster Jinki says: Valdyr, meet us in Amani'zar. You deserve a reward for unmaskin' dis shame of an Amani!\",\"timestamp\":1772808991,\"id\":\"s23_4118\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kel'vujo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kel'vujo says: Hnng! Dis is not fair! You punish me for outsmartin' de trial?\",\"timestamp\":1772809027,\"id\":\"s23_4119\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:269980::::::::90:1480::60:3:13573:13613:13615:2:9:90:28:3321:::::|h[Tuskcarver's Warglaive]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772809028,\"id\":\"s23_4120\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Huntmaster Jinki\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Huntmaster Jinki says: Kel'vujo, you are bein' punished for cheatin' and bein' too dumb to hide it good.\",\"timestamp\":1772809028,\"id\":\"s23_4121\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kagara\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kagara says: Zak'kash is de best of our young fighters. If he is interested in Namaji, there's no way my plan can work!\",\"timestamp\":1772809034,\"id\":\"s23_4122\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Huntmaster Jinki\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Huntmaster Jinki says: You should've softened Starphage before you attacked and not squealed like a pango when it didn't go your way.\",\"timestamp\":1772809037,\"id\":\"s23_4123\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zak'kash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zak'kash says: I hope Kagara don't like her, or I won't stand a chance. He's the smartest kid in de village!\",\"timestamp\":1772809037,\"id\":\"s23_4124\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Huntmaster Jinki\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Huntmaster Jinki says: Maybe a few years with a spear in your gut will teach you a lesson.\",\"timestamp\":1772809045,\"id\":\"s23_4125\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Ya might see familiar faces in Atal'Aman... but I doubt they're as friendly as they once were.\",\"timestamp\":1772809050,\"id\":\"s23_4126\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx500\",\"timestamp\":1772809055,\"id\":\"s23_4127\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:263318::::::::90:1480::14::1:28:3086:::::|h[Simple Amani Basket]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772809061,\"id\":\"s23_4128\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Old Teo'zan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Old Teo'zan says: It was huge. De biggest murloc I've ever seen. Could it be... a loa? I'm not gonna go down there and find out!\",\"timest