\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Elder Doru says: You're back. Good. Do de shrines hold their positions well?\",\"timestamp\":1772811555,\"id\":\"s23_4353\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:259967::::::::90:1480::11::1:28:3321:::::|h[Amani Hex Stave]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772811558,\"id\":\"s23_4354\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elder Doru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Elder Doru says: Throw your sympathies aside, Starphage.\",\"timestamp\":1772811566,\"id\":\"s23_4355\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elder Doru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Elder Doru says: None of them are your actual companions.\",\"timestamp\":1772811570,\"id\":\"s23_4356\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Torundo the Grizzled\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Torundo the Grizzled says: They are merely Atal'aman's memories, experiencin' neither pain nor death.\",\"timestamp\":1772811574,\"id\":\"s23_4357\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Tyllan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Tyllan says: Hrmmph. I'll counteract this with a cantrip soon <CROOAAK>... Oh my!\",\"timestamp\":1772811581,\"id\":\"s23_4358\"}