":{\"name\":\"Warlord Akutu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Warlord Akutu says: Give me dat liver. I'll try anythin'.\",\"timestamp\":1772813775,\"id\":\"s23_4563\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Sij'ta\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Sij'ta says: I want answers. And I will get dem from Kulzi himself!\",\"timestamp\":1772813778,\"id\":\"s23_4564\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warlord Akutu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Warlord Akutu says: Kulzi! I sacrifice dis part of ya flesh to heal me and reject death. I demand your healin' power!\",\"timestamp\":1772813784,\"id\":\"s23_4565\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kulzi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kulzi says: You are a friend to the loa.\",\"timestamp\":1772813796,\"id\":\"s23_4566\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kulzi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kulzi says: We will speak.\",\"timestamp\":1772813800,\"id\":\"s23_4567\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kulzi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kulzi says: They do know the reality, deep down. Whether they can face it--that is their challenge.\",\"timestamp\":1772813804,\"id\":\"s23_4568\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kulzi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kulzi says: Find the shattered staff at the healing altar, and you will learn more.\",\"timestamp\":1772813811,\"id\":\"s23_4569\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Unrepentant Spirit\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Unrepentant Spirit says: De loa's healin' is ours alone!\",\"timestamp\":1772813812,\"id\":\"s23_4570\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:246210::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Shattered Staff]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772813814,\"id\":\"s23_4571\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Memory of Loa Speaker Sij'ta\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Memory of Loa Speaker Sij'ta says: We insulted Kulzi with our demands, Warlord. He says death already claim you--\",\"timestamp\":1772813817,\"id\":\"s23_4572\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Memory of Warlord Akutu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Memory of Warlord Akutu says: Dat loa will do as I say. Here. Take dis hexlord staff. We take Kulzi's power for de glory of Zul'jin!\",\"timestamp\":1772813824,\"id\":\"s23_4573\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Memory of Loa Speaker Sij'ta\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Memory of Loa Speaker Sij'ta says: Hexlord staff? But anyone who use de staff... it is a dark ting--\",\"timestamp\":1772813831,\"id\":\"s23_4574\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 3 Gold, 29 Silver, 29 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1772813833,\"id\":\"s23_4575\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Memory of Warlord Akutu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Memory of Warlord Akutu says: You are a \\\"Loa Speaker,\\\" right? So speak to it! Make Kulzi work for us! You made de oath!\",\"timestamp\":1772813836,\"id\":\"s23_4576\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Forgetful Ghost\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Forgetful Ghost says: De loa is evil, holding us here.\",\"timestamp\":1772813858,\"id\":\"s23_4577\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Forgetful Ghost\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Forgetful Ghost says: That's de staff! When it broke, burnin' magic spewed out. I don't want to remember dis.\",\"timestamp\":1772813865,\"id\":\"s23_4578\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Northernmist-BlackwaterRaiders\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Northernmist-BlackwaterRaiders:1786:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaNorthernmist|r]|h: good morning  