ER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Forgetful Ghost says: I won't face dis. You can't make me.\",\"timestamp\":1772813895,\"id\":\"s23_4585\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Forgetful Ghost\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Forgetful Ghost says: De loa is evil, holding us here.\",\"timestamp\":1772813899,\"id\":\"s23_4586\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Unrepentant Spirit\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Unrepentant Spirit says: Was I... already dead?\",\"timestamp\":1772813903,\"id\":\"s23_4587\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Pangopup\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Pangopup attempts to run away in fear!\",\"timestamp\":1772813905,\"id\":\"s23_4588\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Forgetful Ghost\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Forgetful Ghost says: We swore an oath to de warlord. Is dat holding us here?\",\"timestamp\":1772813908,\"id\":\"s23_4589\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Forgetful Ghost\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Forgetful Ghost says: That's de staff! When it broke, burnin' magic spewed out. I don't want to remember dis.\",\"timestamp\":1772813908,\"id\":\"s23_4590\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Forgetful Ghost\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Forgetful Ghost says: I won't face dis. You can't make me.\",\"timestamp\":1772813912,\"id\":\"s23_4591\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Forgetful Ghost\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Forgetful Ghost says: De loa is evil, holding us here.\",\"timestamp\":1772813915,\"id\":\"s23_4592\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Forgetful Ghost\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Forgetful Ghost says: I remember dis magic burnin' my eyes. De staff broke. We... died.\",\"timestamp\":1772813926,\"id\":\"s23_4593\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Forgetful Ghost\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Forgetful Ghost says: That's de staff! When it broke, burnin' magic spewed out. I don't want to remember dis.\",\"timestamp\":1772813930,\"id\":\"s23_4594\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Forgetful Ghost\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Forgetful Ghost says: If de loa won't heal him, de warlord was right to use the staff to punish it!\",\"timestamp\":1772813937,\"id\":\"s23_4595\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Forgetful Ghost\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Forgetful Ghost says: I remember dying. At least it was swift. De staff must've had somethin' evil inside.\",\"timestamp\":1772813947,\"id\":\"s23_4596\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warlord Akutu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Warlord Akutu says: I can't be dead. It is a trick. You are wrong!\",\"timestamp\":1772813966,\"id\":\"s23_4597\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warlord Akutu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Warlord Akutu says: De loa put you up to dis. He's up there, isn't he? I'll kill 'im!\",\"timestamp\":1772813970,\"id\":\"s23_4598\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Sij'ta\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Sij'ta says: I just want de truth.\",\"timestamp\":1772813976,\"id\":\"s23_4599\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warlord Akutu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Warlord Akutu yells: You'll pay for dis, Kulzi!\",\"timestamp\":1772813980,\"id\":\"s23_4600\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kulzi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kulzi says: You know what this staff means now, Sij'ta?\",\"timestamp\":1772813981,\"id\":\"s23_4601\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"name\":\"Hhyyzzll-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Hhyyzzll-Mal'Ganis:1815:GUILD:|h[|cffc69b6dHhyyzzll|r]|h: good morning yall\",\"timestamp\":1772813983,\"id\":\"s23_4602\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Sij'ta\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Sij'ta says: Yes. It's a hexlord staff made to harm loa. When I broke it, it... backfired dark magic. I didn't mean to be harmin' anyone.\",\"timestamp\":1772813986,\"id\":\"s23_4603\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warlord Akutu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Warlord Akutu says: You shoulda used it, Sij'ta! Oathbreaker!\",\"timestamp\":1772813993,\"id\":\"s23_4604\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Sij'ta\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Sij'ta says: Give me de broken staff, Starphage.\",\"timestamp\":1772813997,\"id\":\"s23_4605\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raiding Rogue\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Raiding Rogue says: Healer! Healer?!\",\"timestamp\":1772814032,\"id\":\"s23_4606\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Budd Nedreck\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Budd Nedreck says: I can only assume that you know who I am, and yet you insist on disturbing me?\",\"timestamp\":1772814039,\"id\":\"s23_4607\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Northernmist-BlackwaterRaiders\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Northernmist-BlackwaterRaiders:1821:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaNorthernmist|r]|h: Friday is the Best \",\"timestamp\":1772814057,\"id\":\"s23_4608\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Budd Nedreck\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Budd Nedreck says: Oh come now, don't be ridiculous! I'm the one and only Budd Nedreck!\",\"timestamp\":1772814060,\"id\":\"s23_4609\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1772814064,\"id\":\"s23_4610\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Harrison Jones\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Harrison Jones says: A word to the wise, stranger: go back to wherever you're from!\",\"timestamp\":1772814069,\"id\":\"s23_4611\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Harrison Jones\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Harrison Jones says: Are you here to train in Archaeology?\",\"timestamp\":1772814078,\"id\":\"s23_4612\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:258138::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Potent Healing Potion]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1772814096,\"id\":\"s23_4613\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx4\",\"timestamp\":1772814097,\"id\":\"s23_4614\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"name\":\"Hhyyzzll-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Hhyyzzll-Mal'Ganis:1828:GUILD:|h[|cffc69b6dHhyyzzll|r]|h: its bis\",\"timestamp\":1772814101,\"id\":\"s23_4615\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Torundo the Grizzled\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Torundo the Grizzled says: Admit it, Doru. You love how all dis reminds you of de old days.\",\"timestamp\":1772814108,\"id\":\"s23_4616\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elder Doru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Elder Doru says: Hah! All it reminds me of is draggin' your sorry, beaten self off de battlefield over and over again.\",\"timestamp\":1772814114,\"id\":\"s23_4617\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Torundo the Grizzled\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Torundo the Grizzled says: Though they shamed us in life, your work to