k says: Hurry, Starphage. The manifestations are weakening En'liahn.\",\"id\":\"s24_2947\",\"timestamp\":1772821576},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: I can't hear her song anymore. She's gone.\",\"id\":\"s24_2948\",\"timestamp\":1772821587},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amarakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: It is said that Morta'ka is the shadow of the first of the Hara'ti to fall to the madness of the rift.\",\"id\":\"s24_2949\",\"timestamp\":1772821589},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: I know what's next. I must kill Morta'ka.\",\"id\":\"s24_2950\",\"timestamp\":1772821590},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amarakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: En'liahn, no. You're too weak!\",\"id\":\"s24_2951\",\"timestamp\":1772821593},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: Once I kill you, I'll be a Shul'ka.\",\"id\":\"s24_2952\",\"timestamp\":1772821601},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Morta'ka the Sundered Echo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mor