 achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61734:Player-11-0EB2CF52:1:3:7:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Endgame]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s24_4612\",\"timestamp\":1772908202},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: The Sunwell holds for now, only through the constant effort of its defenders. Should their strength waver...\",\"id\":\"s24_4613\",\"timestamp\":1772908265},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Bishop Alonsus Faol has a plan to support those at the Sunwell. And to help Arator.\",\"id\":\"s24_4614\",\"timestamp\":1772908272},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Neonvoid! We're going to save the Sunwell. More importantly, we're going to fix that broken young man.\",\"id\":\"s24_4615\",\"timestamp\":1772908278},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx5\",\"id\":\"s24_4616\",\"timestamp\":1772908282},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Such a troubled boy. That'll happen when your father leaves a gaping wound in your chest. Not to worry--I have a plan.\",\"id\":\"s24_4617\",\"timestamp\":1772908284},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Asking for me to inspire anyone? Faol always was an original thinker.\",\"id\":\"s24_4618\",\"timestamp\":1772908298},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Guard\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The nearby guard glares at you and the void energy that you surround yourself with.\",\"id\":\"s24_4619\",\"timestamp\":1772908342},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Neonvoid\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Neonvoid prepares a delicious batch of Everything Stew for everyone to enjoy!\",\"id\":\"s24_4620\",\"timestamp\":1772908350},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Neonvoid\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s24_4621\",\"timestamp\":1772908410},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Ah good! You're both here. There is a crisis of faith that we need to fix!\",\"id\":\"s24_4622\",\"timestamp\":1772908434},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx5\",\"id\":\"s24_4623\",\"timestamp\":1772908438},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ6:|Hitem:237811::::::::80:258::11::1:28:3321:::::|h[Faol's Benediction]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s24_4624\",\"timestamp\":1772908438},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: That's your solution? To zap them with your staff?\",\"id\":\"s24_4625\",\"timestamp\":1772908438},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Hmmph. Those defenders have exhausted themselves, giving of their own faith and power. We bolster their reserves.\",\"id\":\"s24_4626\",\"timestamp\":1772908444},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver says: My skills in warpweaving can only do so much to help you. But I shall do my best.\",\"id\":\"s24_4627\",\"timestamp\":1772908460},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Mehavecookie-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mehavecookie-Area52|h[|cff8788eeMehavecookie-Area52|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62336:Player-3676-0EACC7C7:1:3:7:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Abundance: Contributer]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s24_4628\",\"timestamp\":1772908503},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Mehavecookie-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mehavecookie-Area52|h[|cff8788eeMehavecookie-Area52|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62339:Player-3676-0EACC7C7:1:3:7:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Abundance: Gambler]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s24_4629\",\"timestamp\":1772908503},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen yells: The Sunwell is a conduit for the Light! Made holy through the sacrifice of the naaru Mu'ru!\",\"id\":\"s24_4630\",\"timestamp\":1772908504},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen yells: I know you are tired. It is hard to continue, but we must!\",\"id\":\"s24_4631\",\"timestamp\":1772908512},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"General Amias Bellamy\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"General Amias Bellamy says: I'm worried that Void Elf might sneak back in here and disrupt our efforts at the Sunwell.\",\"id\":\"s24_4632\",\"timestamp\":1772908522},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"War Chaplain Senn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"War Chaplain Senn says: I have marshalled what priests were available to ward against the Void. It won't repel the Devouring Host, but will prevent contamination from any undesirable mortals.\",\"id\":\"s24_4633\",\"timestamp\":1772908528},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen yells: Should the Sunwell fall, we have no way to stop the Devouring Host!\",\"id\":\"s24_4634\",\"timestamp\":1772908531},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen yells: We have taken different paths to reach the Light, but together we assemble for the same purpose. To protect Azeroth!\",\"id\":\"s24_4635\",\"timestamp\":1772908540},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Jainàsolo-MoonGuard\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jainàsolo-MoonGuard|h[|cfff48cbaJainàsolo-MoonGuard|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:6739:Player-3675-0AFAFD56:1:3:7:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Silvershard Mines Victory]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772908564,\"id\":\"s24_4636\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":