 empower the Sunwell!\",\"id\":\"s26_3476\",\"timestamp\":1773164276},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Would you check in with the Vanguard commanders for me, Stormclout? I must explain to the general why the Sunwell must not fall.\",\"id\":\"s26_3477\",\"timestamp\":1773164278},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Commander Venel Lightblood\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Commander Venel Lightblood says: My soldiers are too accustomed to sparring with the Light. They need to learn the tricks of other martial traditions.\",\"id\":\"s26_3478\",\"timestamp\":1773164286},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"General Amias Bellamy\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"General Amias Bellamy says: You think too provincially. We need the full might of the Vanguard to defeat Xal'atath.\",\"id\":\"s26_3479\",\"timestamp\":1773164287},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Commander Venel Lightblood\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Commander Venel Lightblood says: My soldiers are too accustomed to sparring with the Light. They need to learn the tricks of other martial traditions.\",\"id\":\"s26_3480\",\"timestamp\":1773164382},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Bup-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SAY\",\"type\":\"SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Bup-Tichondrius:805:SAY:|h[|cfff48cbaBup|r]|h says: [Orcish] thok re'ka dogg ka gesh'nuka\",\"id\":\"s26_3481\",\"timestamp\":1773164412},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"War Chaplain Senn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"War Chaplain Senn says: You are a beacon in the darkness. We will succeed, no matter the cost.\",\"id\":\"s26_3482\",\"timestamp\":1773164414},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist says: Get those modifications fitted or we'll suffocate! The air on the other side is thicker than me gran's lamb stew.\",\"id\":\"s26_3483\",\"timestamp\":1773164424},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist says: My gran taught me to fight the good fight, even if it seems hopeless, and to put me faith in the Light.\",\"id\":\"s26_3484\",\"timestamp\":1773164426},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist says: Though, two tons of Light-blessed steel warframe bolsters my courage.\",\"id\":\"s26_3485\",\"timestamp\":1773164435},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"General Amias Bellamy\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"General Amias Bellamy says: We have left you a token force to hold back the Voidstorm. Light willing, it will suffice.\",\"id\":\"s26_3486\",\"timestamp\":1773164450},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: We can't spare the troops! Those ethereal cannons have us pinned down.\",\"id\":\"s26_3487\",\"timestamp\":1773164466},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Claireadora-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Claireadora-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaClaireadora|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61310:Player-11-0EB24FAF:1:3:10:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Casual Collector]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s26_3488\",\"timestamp\":1773164476},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: We're being hit from all sides! We need a tactical assessment. Umbric! Stormclout can assist you.\",\"id\":\"s26_3489\",\"timestamp\":1773164490},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Snekelz-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Snekelz-Mal'Ganis|h[|cfffff468Snekelz-Mal'Ganis|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61641:Player-3684-0EDB876F:1:3:10:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Blinding Vale]|h|