\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Vereesa was the peacekeeper of our family. She spent many days tending to the gardens here, but the wilderness has overtaken it now.\",\"id\":\"s29_4008\",\"timestamp\":1773805887},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Disturbed-BoreanTundra\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Disturbed-BoreanTundra|h[|cff8788eeDisturbed-BoreanTundra|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61184:Player-86-0A69139E:1:3:17:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Challenger II: Midnight Season 1]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s29_4009\",\"timestamp\":1773805890},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Disturbed-BoreanTundra\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Disturbed-BoreanTundra|h[|cff8788eeDisturbed-BoreanTundra|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61490:Player-86-0A69139E:1:3:17:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Season 1: Champion of the Dawn]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s29_4010\",\"timestamp\":1773805890},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Smileclap-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Smileclap-Mal'Ganis receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::90:269:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s29_4011\",\"timestamp\":1773805911},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Bl