p|r]|h whispers: bet loading in \",\"timestamp\":1773844517,\"id\":\"s29_4848\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"LightforgedDraenei\",\"name\":\"Sneakybution-Ysondre\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Sneakybution-Ysondre|h[|cfff48cbaSneakybution-Ysondre|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62142:Player-78-0FAC896B:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[I Didn't Hear No Bell]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773844521,\"id\":\"s29_4849\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Groppeta-Ragnaros\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Groppeta-Ragnaros|h[|cfffff468Groppeta-Ragnaros|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61805:Player-1427-0E47F54D:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 9 (Season 1)]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773844611,\"id\":\"s29_4850\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:244573::::::::90:1480::13:7:12214:12497:12066:8960:12384:8793:12667:9:28:3615:29:36:30:49:38:8:40:4005:47:232875:48:240167:49:245784:51:246211:::::|h[Silvermoon Agent's Utility Belt |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-Tier5:17:15::1|a]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1773844623,\"id\":\"s29_4851\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Baa'lial\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.7098039388656616,\"b\":0.9215686917304993},\"text\":\"Baa'lial whispers: Blood will flow. Cities will burn. All will be ash and flame.\",\"timestamp\":1773844632,\"id\":\"s29_4852\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1773844680,\"id\":\"s29_4853\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Your redeployment leaves a scant few behind to empower the Sunwell!\",\"timestamp\":1773844698,\"id\":\"s29_4854\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Would you check in with the Vanguard commanders for me, Starphage? I must explain to the general why the Sunwell must not fall.\",\"timestamp\":1773844703,\"id\":\"s29_4855\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"General Amias Bellamy\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"General Amias Bellamy says: You think too provincially. We need the full might of the Vanguard to defeat Xal'atath.\",\"timestamp\":1773844712,\"id\":\"s29_4856\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"War Chaplain Senn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"War Chaplain Senn says: You are a beacon in the darkness. We will succeed, no matter the cost.\",\"timestamp\":1773844719,\"id\":\"s29_4857\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist says: Get those modifications fitted or we'll suffocate! The air on the other side is thicker than me gran's lamb stew.\",\"timestamp\":1773844723,\"id\":\"s29_4858\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist says: My gran taught me to fight the good fight, even if it seems hopeless, and to put me faith in the Light.\",\"timestamp\":1773844727,\"id\":\"s29_4859\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"War Chaplain Senn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"War Chaplain Senn says: You are a beacon in the darkness. We will succeed, no matter the cost.\",\"timestamp\":1773844734,\"id\":\"s29_4860\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist says: Though, two tons of Light-blessed steel warframe bolsters my courage.\",\"timestamp\":1773844735,\"id\":\"s29_4861\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"General Amias Bellamy\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"General Amias Bellamy says: We have left you a token force to hold back the Voidstorm. Light willing, it will suffice.\",\"timestamp\":1773844745,\"id\":\"s29_4862\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx5\",\"timestamp\":1773844746,\"id\":\"s29_4863\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: We both claim the Light as our guide, but yours is a sterile, cold faith I scarcely recognize.\",\"timestamp\":1773844752,\"id\":\"s29_4864\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: We can't spare the troops! Those ethereal cannons have us pinned down.\",\"timestamp\":1773844762,\"id\":\"s29_4865\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx5\",\"timestamp\":1773844764,\"id\":\"s29_4866\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: We're being hit from all sides! We need a tactical assessment. Umbric! Starphage can assist you.\",\"timestamp\":1773844764,\"id\":\"s29_4867\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: With this device, you'll be able to view the tactical situation in relative safety.\",\"timestamp\":1773844770,\"id\":\"s29_4868\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1773844809,\"id\":\"s29_4869\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: The captured ren'dorei are links in a chain. Break that chain, and our assault can truly begin.\",\"timestamp\":1773844810,\"id\":\"s29_4870\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Nineninesix-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Nineninesix-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffNineninesix|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:40436:Player-11-0EA8482C:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[You're Getting a Delve!]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773844818,\"id\":\"s29_4871\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: The Void enslaves you, while I am empowered by it!\",\"timestamp\":1773844823,\"id\":\"s29_4872\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":