\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Nnethir-Stormrage|h[|cff3fc7ebNnethir-Stormrage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61806:Player-60-0FA2652E:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 10 (Season 1)]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773845292,\"id\":\"s29_4929\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: I assume Arator sent you to help me? I could use another pair of hands.\",\"timestamp\":1773845300,\"id\":\"s29_4930\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: Scraps of a Vanguard uniform... officer emblem... just as I thought.\",\"timestamp\":1773845302,\"id\":\"s29_4931\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Jabsjibs-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Jabsjibs-Tichondrius:1340:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebJabsjibs|r]|h: gz dude\",\"timestamp\":1773845310,\"id\":\"s29_4932\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: They're abducting the Vanguard's officers, Starphage. Is this just the hunger of the beasts, or is Xal'atath gathering intelligence?\",\"timestamp\":1773845311,\"id\":\"s29_4933\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Nnethir-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Nnethir-Stormrage|h[|cff3fc7ebNnethir-Stormrage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61809:Player-60-0FA2652E:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Adventurer of the Dawn]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773845319,\"id\":\"s29_4934\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx5\",\"timestamp\":1773845324,\"id\":\"s29_4935\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Nnethir-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Nnethir-Stormrage|h[|cff3fc7ebNnethir-Stormrage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61679:Player-60-0FA2652E:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Epic]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773845325,\"id\":\"s29_4936\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: Stay alert, Starphage. These creatures can come from anywhere.\",\"timestamp\":1773845325,\"id\":\"s29_4937\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Pie-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Pie-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebPie|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62159:Player-11-0EAE0154:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Prey: Bloody Green Thumbs (Hard)]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773845330,\"id\":\"s29_4938\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: This was one of the soldiers from the Vanguard. They must've been dragged from their cot, then feasted upon here in the gorge.\",\"timestamp\":1773845331,\"id\":\"s29_4939\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: This body is half-eaten, torn apart by those scavengers.\",\"timestamp\":1773845345,\"id\":\"s29_4940\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: This blood is fresh... wait, Starphage. Do you hear that?\",\"timestamp\":1773845354,\"id\":\"s29_4941\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nadia Brighton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nadia Brighton says: By the Light--get off me, you beast!\",\"timestamp\":1773845358,\"id\":\"s29_4942\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: A survivor! We're not too late!\",\"timestamp\":1773845364,\"id\":\"s29_4943\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nadia Brighton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nadia Brighton says: Oh no. Not another portal!\",\"timestamp\":1773845371,\"id\":\"s29_4944\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: Quickly, Starphage! I'll hold the rift open for you, and you can jump through and rescue her.\",\"timestamp\":1773845378,\"id\":\"s29_4945\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nadia Brighton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nadia Brighton says: Hello? Is anyone there? I need help!\",\"timestamp\":1773845380,\"id\":\"s29_4946\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:257216::::::::90:1480::31:1:13634:1:28:3320:::::|h[Voidbreaker's Striders]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1773845381,\"id\":\"s29_4947\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1773845382,\"id\":\"s29_4948\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nadia Brighton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nadia Brighton says: You're not with the Vanguard. Not that I mind the rescue. Who was that woman you were with?\",\"timestamp\":1773845389,\"id\":\"s29_4949\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nadia Brighton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nadia Brighton says: Was that the High Exarch's wife? I mean girlfriend. I thought she'd be taller. Is it true she has a dark naaru for a heart?\",\"timestamp\":1773845395,\"id\":\"s29_4950\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nadia Brighton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nadia Brighton says: That's the big bastard that brought me here.\",\"timestamp\":1773845400,\"id\":\"s29_4951\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nadia Brighton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nadia Brighton says: Time to light 'im up!\",\"timestamp\":1773845404,\"id\":\"s29_4952\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1773845420,\"id\":\"s29_4953\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\"